<title>UK: Sullom Voe liftings rose by half last week.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe liftings rose by half last week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent blend loadings from Britan's Sullom Voe terminal rose to 805,889 tonnes in the week to February 11 compared to 529,088 tonnes the previous week, Shetland Islands Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>About 44 percent of this oil, or 356,214 tonnes went to refineries in north America while the rest remained in northwest Europe.</p>
